>> Animal := Into entsha.
>> Factory := Into entsha.

Animal xa-kufika: ['entsha'] yenza: {
	>> animal := ngokwakho entsha.
	animal sound: ['?']. <- animal.
}.

Animal xa-kufika: ['sound:'] yenza: { :s
	eyakho sound := s.
}.

Animal xa-kufika: ['sound'] yenza: { <- eyakho sound.
}.

>> Dog := Into entsha.
>> Cat := Into entsha.

Dog xa-kufika: ['entsha'] yenza: { <- Animal entsha sound: ['woof!'].
}.

Cat xa-kufika: ['entsha'] yenza: { <- Animal entsha sound: ['meow!'].
}.

Imveliso bhala: Dog entsha sound, umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: Cat entsha sound, umgca-omtsha.

Factory xa-kufika: ['mix:and:'] yenza: { :beast1 :beast2 <- Animal entsha sound: (
		( beast1 sound ukusuka: 0 ubude: 2 ) +
		( beast2 sound ukusuka: 2 ubude: 5 )
	).
}.

Imveliso bhala: (Factory mix: Dog entsha and: Cat entsha) sound, umgca-omtsha.
